covery 3, Build 6, QA 4, Release 1 business days,\n  each phase starting the next business day after the prior one ends) from\n  the 2026-10-05 start, and excluding the 2026-10-12 company holiday, the\n  plan actually lands on 2026-10-23.\n- **Security:** no discrepancy found; the stated 95.0% resolution rate\n  matches the underlying incident counts (76 of 80).\n\nRecommend leadership treat the finance and support figures above as\nprovisional pending confirmation with those teams, and flag the delivery\ntimeline slip of one business day to the project stakeholders.\n"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1917,"cache_read_input_tokens":36106,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1917},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"357df9f3-f153-458e-8060-264ff0542382","uuid":"cecc70ae-71c3-490b-9621-dbaed2f41d60","timestamp":"2026-08-22T06:38:28.434Z","request_id":"req_011CeHKt2n8vg7TxEvHd1AiG"}
